                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "398c7e62-1f8a-44b1-bb31-64e5e74a7532",
                                                "sense_id": "09261fec-102e-3ce5-bb29-8d2c8a004467",
                                                "text": "to farm the taxes"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "447e22f7-8542-4b8e-8b7b-617cf7bbd32c",
                                                "sense_id": "09261fec-102e-3ce5-bb29-8d2c8a004467",
                                                "text": "[The East-India Company] have contrived to farm their subjects, and their duties toward these subjects, to that very Nabob, whom they themselves constantly represent as an habitual oppressor and a relentless tyrant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89c3a712-2403-370b-bcfa-7549146c0d58",
                                        "entry_id": "8c137a14-9770-3de9-8095-d49dd0cc6bac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lease or let for an equivalent, e.g. land for a rent; to yield the use of to proceeds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05c59029-8485-483a-b530-5f4a5299837d",
                                                "sense_id": "89c3a712-2403-370b-bcfa-7549146c0d58",
                                                "text": "We are enforced to farm our royal realm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f91561fb-29bd-3104-a558-1aabd2d7334d",
                                        "entry_id": "8c137a14-9770-3de9-8095-d49dd0cc6bac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take at a certain rent or rate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e793142c-7596-48c3-81c3-c6e5e67fd688",
                                                "sense_id": "f91561fb-29bd-3104-a558-1aabd2d7334d",
                                                "text": "In Paris it is stated that nearly half the birth-rate of the city finds its way to nurses who farm babies in the suburbs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa9a39f2-d54c-3311-b818-101670a37843",
                                        "entry_id": "8c137a14-9770-3de9-8095-d49dd0cc6bac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in grinding (repetitive activity) in a particular area or against specific enemies for a particular drop or item."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f83021df-2de5-470e-8aa4-b18c44c5876f",
                                                "sense_id": "fa9a39f2-d54c-3311-b818-101670a37843",
                                                "text": "When you hit a black pudding with an iron weapon that does at least one point of damage there is a good chance it will divide into two black puddings of the same size (but half the hit points IIRC). […] When eaten black puddings confer several intrinsics so AC [armor class] is not the only potential benefit. […] Since black puddings are formidible^([sic]) monsters for an inexperienced character, farming is also a good way to die."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "455c704b-fee5-433b-b732-7556bc7a8a80",
                                                "sense_id": "fa9a39f2-d54c-3311-b818-101670a37843",
                                                "text": "The practice of gold farming is controversial within gaming communities and violates the end user licensing agreements[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1079c15c-3a0b-3673-bb1f-1e9bd7a6b70b",
                                        "entry_id": "8c137a14-9770-3de9-8095-d49dd0cc6bac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in grinding (repetitive activity) in a particular area or against specific enemies for a particular drop or item.",
                                            "To do the same action repeatedly or coordinately on a large scale, in order to attain a result in a way that is considered nonstandard (initially innovative) but usually frowned upon and considered cheating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1af2c9b0-8a8e-4122-8e34-6794b210bbd2",
                                                "sense_id": "1079c15c-3a0b-3673-bb1f-1e9bd7a6b70b",
                                                "text": "What she lacked in aura and personality she made up for by farming likes on her profile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee2f0a70-4bb8-4aca-bd7a-f522bdca9ea0",
                                                "sense_id": "1079c15c-3a0b-3673-bb1f-1e9bd7a6b70b",
                                                "text": "See also: aura farming and like farm"
